-- Tenkai-owned drop-in for compositor settings (docs/DECISIONS.md §2).
--
-- tenkai-hub regenerates this file on every Save from the Window Manager
-- page, and the shipped hyprland.lua loads it with optional("tenkai_settings").
-- It is the persisted half of the live-apply path: a Save takes effect at once
-- through `hyprctl eval`, and a fresh boot reads the same values here before the
-- shell's daemon re-applies them.
--
-- Do not edit this file: the next Save overwrites it. Put permanent changes in
-- ~/.config/hypr/user.lua (loaded last, after this file) or in the page itself.
--
-- This shipped copy is empty on purpose; install.sh places it only when none
-- exists, so an installed session's generated values are never clobbered.
